    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d526">

                <pb facs="0603" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg523"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-06-14"><hi rendition="#italic">June 14,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 941.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your No. 868 of the 3d instant, with
                    inclosures, has been received.</p>
                <p>The Department has noted with appreciation the readiness with which His Majesty’s
                    Government acceded to the request to authorize Mr. Elliot to take temporary
                    charge of American interests in Bulgaria.</p>
                <p>You will express to Lora Lansdowne this Government’s thanks for the courtesy so
                    promptly extended.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
